{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在各种意义上都算养足了精神，然后来到了决胜负的星期日。", "text_idx": 442, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "必须在明天早上前完成这个蛋糕。", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呵呵，带着过夜用品来学校，好不可思议的感觉喔……”", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2921", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是的，我们已经做好今晚通宵的觉悟了。", "text_idx": 473, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“大家今天也是这么打算才来的吧。”", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呵呵，就好像文化祭之类的活动前一晚呢。”", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2922", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“像结女这样的大小姐学校，在这种时候也会有人睡在学校吗？”", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就是因为是这种时候啊。”", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2923", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而且兰华小姐也会当作没看见。跟安洁一起偷偷地巡视大家呢。”", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2924", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈，原来如此，可以想像得到那个画面。”", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过今天不用装作没看到，因为已经取得许可了。”", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "刚才出门前，已经打电话给学园长告知今天可能会过夜了。", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学园长接到电话后，很爽快就同意了。", "text_idx": 448, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过只讲了两句话就挂电话，她还是这么忙呢。", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这下子得做出让学园长也惊讶的蛋糕了。”", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个人标准很高嘛～必须要付出相当大的心力才行。”", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2925", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁笑嘻嘻的，真的很开心的样子。", "text_idx": 453, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "应该是期待今天吧。", "text_idx": 458, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当然接下来重头戏的明天也是。", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……那走吧，安洁。”", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好的，主人。”", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2926", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们谈笑着穿过校门。", "text_idx": 467, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……不过，距离其他人来还有一点时间。", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们没有直接去料理实习室，而是在空无一人的走廊上稍微闲晃了一下。", "text_idx": 466, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……咦？”", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当我注意到的时候，身边的安洁消失了。", "text_idx": 459, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁？”", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我以为呼唤之后她会从天花板上出现，但实际上只听见自己的声音在回响。", "text_idx": 464, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真是的……”", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我走到别的地方。", "text_idx": 470, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好久没这样到处找安洁了。", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈哈。”", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想起之前这么做的时候，当时的愉快又涌上心头。", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……找到了。”", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊、主人！”", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2927", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我在安洁以前住的房间找到她了。", "text_idx": 468, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对不起，忍不住就……”", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2928", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没关系，我找到你了。”", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……好久没来这里了呢。”", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是的……话虽如此，其实也只是一个月前事情。”", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2929", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我环视房间。", "text_idx": 469, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "和之前一模一样。", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁来我们家之后，这里就没有人在用吧……？”", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁是这样听说的。不过安洁有时候会来打扫……”", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2930", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她摸了摸榻榻米。", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "非常珍惜的的感觉，这里对她来说有很多回忆吧。", "text_idx": 500, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……真的，还是一模一样。”", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2931", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“像花瓣一样。”", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2932", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“之前来拜访这个房间的时候，我总是这么想。”", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁在榻榻米上跪坐的时候裙子会铺开，简直就像花瓣一样。”", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……成为主人的女仆之后，也没有改变吗？”", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2933", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“从那个时候开始，就一直觉得安洁很可爱了。”", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“又在奇怪的时机说这种话……”", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2934", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈，抱歉抱歉。”", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是看到没有改变的裙子花瓣，我的心跳不可思议地加快也是事实。", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "与她结合前的心动的感觉，现在依然能轻易地想起来。", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁再次摸了摸榻榻米。", "text_idx": 451, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……虽然感觉已经过去很久了，不过在这里生活还是不久前的事。”", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2935", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……”", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“果然和现在的安洁是相连的呢，主人。”", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2936", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为有那些日子，所以才有现在。", "text_idx": 441, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "已经可以如此肯定地说了。", "text_idx": 457, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……所以，必须回报才行。”", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是。”", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2937", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁露出从容的微笑。", "text_idx": 454, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这份从容也是因为“现在”而存在。", "text_idx": 498, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不好意思，主人。现在去料理实习室吧！”", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2938", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们到料理实习室不久后，其他人也陆陆续续前来了。", "text_idx": 465, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是说……好像比星期五的人数更多了……”", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那、那个～新来的各位同学，真的可以吗……？”", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2939", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "結女生徒３年", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哎呀，这种事不参加太可惜了吧！”", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "结女学生3年级", "alt_speaker_idx": 489, "voice": "jt0002", "char_id": "結女生徒３年"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "結女生徒１年", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我们会工作的，安洁学姐！”", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "结女学生1年级", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "jo0003", "char_id": "結女生徒１年"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "星期五时没有参加的人也都纷纷赞同。", "text_idx": 472, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "結女生徒１年", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“虽然赶不上现在这个时间，但是好像有很多人稍后也会过来喔。”", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "结女学生1年级", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "jo0004", "char_id": "結女生徒１年"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……真的很谢谢各位！”", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2940", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那么那么，跟安洁一起做蛋糕吧！”", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2941", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "結女生徒１年", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好！”", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "结女学生1年级", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "jo0005", "char_id": "結女生徒１年"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔唔，安洁好像老师喔……我感觉自己没有立场了……”", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 426, "voice": "mc0225", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不不不，没有那种事啦！”", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天连万智老师都来了。", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“领导……应该说监督吧？总之很谢谢老师你来。”", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这、这个嘛，毕竟这么多学生在假日集合，不但会用火甚至还要过夜，老师不得不来看看啊。”", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 426, "voice": "mc0226", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就是说啊，嗯，很感谢你！”", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……因为接到学园长的电话告诉我这些，所以我才来当监督的。唉，再见了我的假日……”", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 426, "voice": "mc0227", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过，连假日也可以见到新吾君，算是一点小奖励吧……嗯～今天也好可爱……”", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 426, "voice": "mc0228", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最后这句我就当作没听到好了。", "text_idx": 474, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然已经说了会晚到，但是请快点来支援吧，隼太！", "text_idx": 496, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那么要从什么事情开始，安洁？”", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "ar4124", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“打生奶油吗？”", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": "sk1039", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊哈哈，生奶油晚一点再做吧。还有，生奶油大概打８分稠就可以了。”", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2942", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学和樱乃当然也来了。", "text_idx": 479, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对濑名同学来说，假日是可以排打工的重要时间，却还是愿意来学校帮忙我们，太感谢了。", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“早啊～我来了喔！”", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sn0397", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“今天我也来了喔。小熊喵留在家里看家了。”", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 493, "voice": "mu0438", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔，该不会还没开始？原来我赶得及嘛～”", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 499, "voice": "ht0391", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "其他人也都抵达了。", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“首先要做本体的海绵蛋糕吗？”", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 490, "voice": "ja0077", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“正是如此。因为是大型的蛋糕，所以这部分非常重要。”", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2943", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“模具由安洁来处理，各位请分头开始准备面团吧～”", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2944", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "汎用", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔～～～～！！”", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "学生全员", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "go074", "char_id": "汎用"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就这样，为了明天我们一群人斗志高昂地开始制作蛋糕了。", "text_idx": 456, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家热热闹闹地分工合作，不分年级和性别。", "text_idx": 443, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁～蛋黄已经打成缎带状了喔！”", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "结女学生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 491, "voice": "jb0036", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“了解。等蛋白准备好后就可以混合了。”", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2945", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "各務台女子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“面粉的量真惊人……这样光是撒下去就很累了。”", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "各务台女生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 434, "voice": "sa0046", "char_id": "各務台女子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“待会安洁会去帮忙，在那之前请再稍微坚持一下！”", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2946", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嘿咻！我把模具都拿来了。”", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "各务台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "da0054", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢你！安洁之后会确认的。”", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2947", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁在教室里东奔西跑，今天也是摇晃着裙摆指挥大局。", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且不只是指挥。", "text_idx": 494, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁……手酸了……”", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": "sk1040", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“也就是说该安洁出场了呢！”", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2948", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“必杀！不输给电动搅拌器的安洁搅拌～～！”", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2949", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……为什么在旁边用着电动搅拌的我，认真地觉得输了。”", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "ar4125", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "結女生徒１年", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好厉害……要吃什么才能变成那样呢？”", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "结女学生1年级", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "jo0006", "char_id": "結女生徒１年"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“硬要说的话就是爱情吧……”", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2950", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“开玩笑的啦！啊哈哈！”", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2951", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她大方地施展技术，一旁的同学们都佩服得不得了。", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“很好安洁，跟我一决胜负吧！电动搅拌器和手动作业，我是不会输给你的！”", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sn0398", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呃，现在这个阶段就已经输了吧。”", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 499, "voice": "ht0392", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“吵死了你这只渣虫，给我闭嘴站旁边看！”", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sn0399", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小纱凪，在料理食物的时候不可以说那种话喔！”", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 493, "voice": "mu0439", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之上吧上吧～安洁跟纱凪～”", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 490, "voice": "ja0078", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那我赌安洁好了。”", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "各務台男子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也是！”", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "各务台男生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 436, "voice": "db0034", "char_id": "各務台男子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也是！”", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "结女学生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "jc0064", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "結女生徒１年", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也是～”", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "结女学生1年级", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "jo0007", "char_id": "結女生徒１年"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“给我等一下！？”", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 487, "voice": "sn0400", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呵呵呵。”", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2952", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "两人的行动让教室里热络了起来──", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哇哇，不知不觉就到晚上了！”", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 426, "voice": "mc0229", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“接下来才是重头戏喔！差不多要烤海绵蛋糕了。”", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2953", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为没办法直接烤出整个本体，所以要分段烤。然后把烤好的部分组合起来调整形状。”", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“之后才终于是涂抹奶油啊……真的路还很漫长的感觉呢。”", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 480, "voice": "ar4126", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "結女生徒１年", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呼唔……”", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "结女学生1年级", "alt_speaker_idx": 488, "voice": "jo0008", "char_id": "結女生徒１年"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“睡着了！这女孩睡着了！”", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "结女学生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 490, "voice": "ja0079", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“请大家都先小睡一会吧！烤好后安洁会负责搬的。”", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2954", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不，那种事就交给男生吧！还有安洁才是，你趁这机会睡一下。”", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 471, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "汎用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呀啊～～～～♪”", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "女子一同", "alt_speaker_idx": 444, "voice": "go075", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哥哥，好有主人的感觉。”", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 476, "voice": "sk1041", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊，明明没有睡着，安洁好像置身在梦境里一样～”", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2955", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "蛋糕制作持续到深夜──", "text_idx": 497, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而这个夜晚，也迎来了黎明。", "text_idx": 495, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route02_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……好了！”", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 450, "voice": "ag2956", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
